      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Vaginal tumors in children are uncommon. This report describes the rare case of an atypical smooth muscle tumor arising from the vagina in a pediatric patient managed with tumor resection, vaginal reconstruction, and continent urinary diversion. We also discuss a review of the literature and a brief report detailing our experience with pediatric vaginal tumors."
      },
